## Shared framework: agentic-harness {{HARNESS_VERSION}}

This block is managed by `scripts/harness-sync.sh` of the [agentic-harness](https://github.com/francoisgn/agentic-harness) framework: do not edit it here (propose changes in the framework). The rest of this file belongs to the project and wins over the framework on any conflict, to be reported in an issue.

@.harness/docs/ESSENTIEL.md

Read when relevant (not loaded by default; written in French): method `.harness/docs/METHODOLOGY.md`, conventions `.harness/docs/CONVENTIONS.md`, lessons `.harness/docs/LESSONS.md` (self-review before every PR, alongside the project's own lessons), reviews `.harness/docs/REVIEW-ROUNDS.md`, orchestration and model choice `.harness/docs/ORCHESTRATION.md`, branches and releases `.harness/docs/BRANCHING-RELEASE.md`, CI budget and security `.harness/docs/CI-BUDGET.md`, project README `.harness/docs/README-STANDARD.md`, Mac handoff `.harness/docs/MAC-HANDOFF.md`.
